id=net.prototux.aare.xposed
name=AARE host shims
version=0.1.0
versionCode=1
author=AARE
description=Lets AARE host Android Auto apps that refuse a non-Google host, on a rooted phone: Car App Library apps (Waze) via HostValidator, Google Maps via its CAPTURE_VIDEO_OUTPUT check, media apps (Spotify, VRadio) via their MediaBrowserService caller allowlist, plus AARE's own privileged permissions and MediaProjection. All gated to AARE's uid.
scope=net.prototux.aare
